<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>Terms of Service - Voice2Skill</title>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
</head>
<body class="app">
  <%- include('partials/app-nav', { active: 'terms' }) %>
  <main class="app-wrap app-main" id="main">
    <div class="app-card">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p style="color:#9B9891;">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %></p>

      <h2>Using Voice2Skill</h2>
      <p>Voice2Skill is currently in early beta. Features, pricing, and availability may change as we develop the product. By creating an account, you agree to these terms.</p>

      <h2>Your account</h2>
      <p>You're responsible for keeping your password secure and for all activity under your account. You must provide accurate information at signup. Voice2Skill is intended for users 18 years and older, or younger users with appropriate guardian consent where required by law.</p>

      <h2>AI-generated content</h2>
      <p>Roadmaps, lessons, quizzes, and coaching responses are generated by AI. While we design our prompts carefully, AI-generated content may occasionally contain errors or inaccuracies. Voice2Skill is a learning aid, not a substitute for verified educational sources — always cross-check important technical information.</p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to misuse Voice2Skill — including attempting to access other users' accounts or data, submitting harmful or abusive content in check-ins, or attempting to disrupt the service.</p>

      <h2>No guarantee of outcomes</h2>
      <p>Voice2Skill is designed to support your learning, but we do not guarantee specific employment, income, or skill-mastery outcomes as a result of using the platform.</p>

      <h2>Changes and termination</h2>
      <p>We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms. We may also update these terms as the product develops; continued use after changes means you accept the updated terms.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Reach us at <%= supportEmail || 'support@voice2skill.com' %>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>